Description:
The Mun Hean Group represents an extensive network throughout Asia providing specialised solutions in four key areas; 
1) Power Quality Management; 
2) Power Factor Correction; 
3) Lightning Protection and 
4) Industrial Electrical Solutions. 

The group started from Mun Hean Singapore Pte Ltd which was established in 1981 and has long been the market leaders in industrial electrical marketing with its own MH Protection Relays and MH electrical switchboard instruments. The business has expanded to encompass other electrical solutions in its portfolio. Today, the business involves representing leading manufacturers primarily in Europe, on an exclusive basis to manage specialized projects across Asia. The group comprises of companies in Singapore, Malaysia, Indonesia, Hong Kong, Philippines, Vietnam, Myanmar, Taiwan and China. 

Mun Hean's client-base stretches across a diversity of industries; from power utilities, data centres, government and military installations, hospitals, marine, oil & gas, commercial buildings and manufacturing facilities from semi-conductors to food processing. Over 35 in the industry, Mun Hean boasts a project reference of more than 500,000 installations and applications in landmark projects across Asia. Mun Hean embodies a rich history of electrical engineering excellence with a steadfast adherence to its core value, in Transforming Expertise into Solutions.

Quality and experience at your disposal since 1982. 
The consolidated know-how  of  a thirty years of presence in the market permits us to meet any kind of project requirement you may have, both on industrial and marine field. 
We ensure assistance at every single step of the project process,  providing advice during the engineering stage, the  production, the installation and start up.
All this wherever you are in the world!

In particular  we carry out :

- Industrial electrical Systems,
- Naval Electrical Plants,
- Automation Plants,
- Monitoring Systems,
- Power Center Switchboards, 
- M.C.C. Switchboards, 
- Secondary Switchboards,
- Consoles,
- Starter Panels,
- Electrical Cables for both marine and industrial application 

The strength points of the Company are:
-	Italian best quality and Know-How; 
-       Feasibility studies;
-	Engineering with system dimensioning;
-       Expert consulting on new projects or refitting projects;
- 	Internal tests and certification with class registers;
-	Production completely carried out inside our workshops;
- 	Use of technologically advanced components;
-	Quality check;
-	Commercial services, export and assistance all over the world;
-	Partial or complete installation for new or existing plants, refitting in both naval and industrial fields.

AEIS helps connect electronic industries in Singapore to go beyond borders and boundaries. We are established on 7th November 1973 as a non-profit organization. AEIS continue to focus and strengthen favourable connections for members.

AEIS continue to focus and strengthen favourable connections both locally and internationally. This is achieved through varied creative network channels:
- International trade shows;
- Industrial trade mission trips;
- Industrial specific workshops;
- Partnerships with industrial educators;
- Business matching

Join our memberships today. 
https://www.aeis.org.sg/our-member.html

We provide electronics manufacturing services to OEMs and ODMs of products in the satellite communications, television peripherals, computer peripherals, medical and consumer electronics industries. We are primarily involved in Box Build and Printed Circuit Board Assembly (PCBA) services catering to the needs of the low to moderate volume customers and high product mix for: 
satellite communications products such as Low Noise Block (LNB) converters and satellite signal distribution equipment and accessories; 

television peripherals such as set-top boxes;

computer peripherals; and 

other medical and consumer electronics products.
